9. **Joke at your expense**: Write a lighthearted joke that makes fun of yourself without being too harsh.

10. **Wish list**: Write down little wishes that you hope come true this year.

Remember, always be discreet and mindful of others' feelings. These can be more entertaining when done with permission and in a light-hearted manner. Happy pranking! 🚀💡

